Q = []
def q(a, b, c): Q.append({"quote": a, "by": b, "source": c})
q("Research is a systematized effort to gain new knowledge.","L. L. Redman and A. V. H. Mory","The Romance of Research, 1923")
q("Research comprises defining and redefining problems, formulating hypothesis or suggested solutions; collecting, organising and evaluating data; making deductions and reaching conclusions; and at last carefully testing the conclusions to determine whether they fit the formulating hypothesis.","Clifford Woody","quoted in C. R. Kothari, Research Methodology")
q("Scientific research is systematic, controlled, empirical, and critical investigation of hypothetical propositions about the presumed relations among natural phenomena.","Fred N. Kerlinger","Foundations of Behavioral Research, 1964")
q("A hypothesis is a conjectural statement of the relation between two or more variables.","Fred N. Kerlinger","Foundations of Behavioral Research, 1964")
